  "title": "Vertiv Introduces Cell Site Enclosure to Support C-RAN Network Evolution",
  "summary": "Vertiv, formerly Emerson Network Power, today introduced the Vertiv XTE 601E, an 84-inch all-in-one outdoor enclosure designed specifically to bring flexibility and a reduced equipment footprint to C-RAN network architectures. Now available to customers in North America, the Vertiv XTE 601E is highly configurable and capable of housing network equipment, DC power and batteries within the same enclosure chamber while tailoring the equipment rack space and a number of battery strings to the needs of the site.",
